django.template.base.VariableDoesNotExist: Failed lookup for key [errors] in [{'True': True, 'False': False, 'None': None}, {'widget': {'name': 'body', 'is_hidden': False, 'required': False, 'value': '<p><strong>Welcome to the NWU Events Map!</strong><br>Finding an event is easy and fun - just follow these simple steps:</p><ol><li>Open the <strong>Events Map</strong> <img style="aspect-ratio:65/49;margin-left:8px;vertical-align:middle;" src="/uploads/MapIcon.jpg" width="65" height="49"></li><li>Zoom in or out to find your desired location.</li><li>Click on an <strong>event icon</strong> on the map <img style="aspect-ratio:65/69;margin-left:8px;vertical-align:middle;" src="/uploads/WalkIconOnMap.jpg" width="65" height="69"></li><li>Click the <strong>link</strong> that appears to view event details and register <img style="aspect-ratio:79/55;margin-left:8px;vertical-align:middle;" src="/uploads/WalkLinkOnMap.jpg" width="79" height="55"></li></ol><h3>How to Zoom In and Out on the NWU Events Map</h3><p>The NWU Events Map lets you explore walks and activities around the world. You can zoom in or out easily using either a mouse or a touch screen.</p><h4>Zooming with a Mouse (Desktop or Laptop)</h4><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:524/277;" src="/uploads/MapZoomWithMouse.jpg" width="524" height="277"></figure><ul><li>Place your cursor anywhere on the Events map.</li><li>Scroll the mouse wheel <strong>forward (up)</strong> to zoom in and see events more closely.</li><li>Scroll the mouse wheel <strong>backward (down)</strong> to zoom out and view a wider area.</li><li>Keep scrolling gently until you find the level that feels just right.</li></ul><p><i>Tip: You can also click and drag the map to move around once you’ve zoomed in.</i></p><h4>Zooming with Fingers (Touch Screen)</h4><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:549/277;" src="/uploads/MapZoomWithFingers_4qhBs41.jpg" width="549" height="277"></figure><ul><li>Touch the Events map with <strong>two fingers</strong>.</li><li>Move your fingers <strong>apart (pinch out)</strong> to zoom in.</li><li>Move your fingers <strong>together (pinch in)</strong> to zoom out.</li><li>Adjust slowly until the map shows the area you’d like to explore.</li></ul><p><i>Tip: Use one finger to drag the map and explore nearby locations.</i></p><p><strong>That’s it!</strong><br>Enjoy discovering Nordic Walks and events near you, across your region, and around the world. 🌍🌿</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'attrs': {'class': 'django_ckeditor_5', 'id': 'id_body'}, 'template_name': 'django_ckeditor_5/widget.html'}, 'config': {'toolbar': ['heading', 'codeBlock', '|', 'outdent', 'indent', '|', 'bold', 'italic', 'link', 'underline', 'strikethrough', 'code', 'subscript', 'superscript', 'highlight', '|', 'bulletedList', 'numberedList', 'todoList', '|', 'blockQuote', 'insertImage', '|', 'fontSize', 'fontFamily', 'fontColor', 'fontBackgroundColor', 'mediaEmbed', 'removeFormat', 'insertTable', 'sourceEditing'], 'language': 'en', 'blockToolbar': ['paragraph', 'heading1', 'heading2', 'heading3', '|', 'bulletedList', 'numberedList', '|', 'blockQuote'], 'image': {'toolbar': ['imageTextAlternative', '|', 'imageStyle:alignLeft', 'imageStyle:alignRight', 'imageStyle:alignCenter', 'imageStyle:side', '|', 'toggleImageCaption', '|'], 'styles': ['full', 'side', 'alignLeft', 'alignRight', 'alignCenter']}, 'table': {'contentToolbar': ['tableColumn', 'tableRow', 'mergeTableCells', 'tableProperties', 'tableCellProperties'], 'tableProperties': {'borderColors': [{'color': 'hsl(4, 90%, 58%)', 'label': 'Red'}, {'color': 'hsl(340, 82%, 52%)', 'label': 'Pink'}, {'color': 'hsl(291, 64%, 42%)', 'label': 'Purple'}, {'color': 'hsl(262, 52%, 47%)', 'label': 'Deep Purple'}, {'color': 'hsl(231, 48%, 48%)', 'label': 'Indigo'}, {'color': 'hsl(207, 90%, 54%)', 'label': 'Blue'}], 'backgroundColors': [{'color': 'hsl(4, 90%, 58%)', 'label': 'Red'}, {'color': 'hsl(340, 82%, 52%)', 'label': 'Pink'}, {'color': 'hsl(291, 64%, 42%)', 'label': 'Purp