st.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img style="aspect-ratio:717/518;cursor:zoom-in;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelViewCLonedEventInList.jpg" alt="Admin Panel – View Cloned Event in List" width="717" height="518"></a></figure></li><li style="margin-bottom:14px;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;"><p style="margin-left:22px;"><strong>Edit the Cloned Event</strong><br>Click on the <strong>CLONE EVENT</strong> and update all fields so they match your new event:</p><ul style="margin-bottom:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8px;"><li><p style="margin-left:18px;">Date &amp; time</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:18px;">Location</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:18px;">Any other details</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:18px;">✏️ Don’t forget to update the event description text box</p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:22px;">Make it warm, welcoming, and inspiring - just like your group!</p><figure class="image"><a href="/uploads/AdminPanelViewCloneEvent.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img style="aspect-ratio:1877/640;cursor:zoom-in;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelViewCloneEvent.jpg" alt="Admin Panel – Cloned Event View" width="1877" height="640"></a></figure></li><li style="margin-bottom:14px;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;"><p style="margin-left:22px;"><strong>Save and Publish</strong><br>When everything looks right:</p><ul style="margin-bottom:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8px;"><li><p style="margin-left:18px;">✔️ Check the <strong>Website is Ready</strong> checkbox</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:18px;">Click the <strong>SAVE</strong> button</p><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:473/241;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelWebsiteIsReady.jpg" width="473" height="241"></figure></li></ul></li><li style="margin-bottom:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;"><p style="margin-left:22px;"><strong>Your Event Is Live! 🎉</strong><br>Your event is now live on the NWU website!<br>You and your group co-organizers will receive a confirmation email shortly.<br><br>Have a wonderful time wa