mage below to enlarge (opens in a new tab):</div><figure class="image"><a href="/uploads/AdminPanelMainSections_yxdYxN6.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img style="aspect-ratio:884/396;cursor:zoom-in;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelMainSections_yxdYxN6.jpg" alt="Admin Panel – Main Sections" width="884" height="396"></a></figure></li><li><p style="margin-left:22px;"><strong>Open the List of Events:</strong><br>Click on <strong>List of Events</strong>.<br>On the right side, you’ll see your existing event(s).<br>&nbsp;</p><figure class="image"><a href="/uploads/AdminPanelListOfEvents_nv6TzCd.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img style="aspect-ratio:1898/359;cursor:zoom-in;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelListOfEvents_nv6TzCd.jpg" alt="Admin Panel – List of Events" width="1898" height="359"></a></figure></li><li style="margin-bottom:14px;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;"><p style="margin-left:22px;"><strong>Search for the event you want to cancel</strong><br>You can easily sort events by clicking on the names of the columns and using the sidebar filters.</p><figure class="image"><a href="/uploads/AdminPanelSortEvents.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img style="aspect-ratio:1895/525;cursor:zoom-in;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelSortEvents.jpg" alt="Admin Panel – Sort Events" width="1895" height="525"></a></figure></li><li style="margin-bottom:14px;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;"><p style="margin-left:22px;"><strong>Cancel the event</strong><br>✔️ Check the box next to any event (for example: “John Sunny Walkers Riga”). <i>(You can select more than one event.)</i><br><br>Then:</p><ul style="margin-bottom:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8px;padding:0;"><li><p style="margin-left:20px;">Open the <strong>Action</strong> dropdown</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:20px;">Select <strong>Freeze Selected Events</strong></p></li><li><p style="margin-left:20px;">Click the <strong>Go</strong> button</p></li></ul><p style="margin:10px 0 0;">Now your event is cancelled. It will be removed from the NWU website, and all participants will be notified that the event is cancelled.</p><figure class="image"><a href="/uploads/AdminPanelFreezeSelectedEvent.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img style="aspect-ratio:744/475;cursor:zoom-in;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelFreezeSelectedEvent.jpg" alt="Admin Panel – Freeze Selected Event" width="744" height="475"></a></figure></li><li style="margin-bottom:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;"><p style="margin-left:22px;"><strong>Manage a canceled event (Reschedule it easily!)</strong><br>If you want to reschedule this event by keeping all the information, but changing the date, you can:<br><br>✔️ Check the box next to the event (for example: “John Sunny Walkers Riga”).<br><br>Then:</p><ul style="margin-bottom:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8px;padding:0;"><li><p style="margin-left:20px;">Open the <strong>Action</strong> dropdown</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:20px;">Select <strong>Unfreeze Selected Events</strong></p></li><li><p style="margin-left:20px;">Click the <strong>Go</strong> button</p><figure class="image"><a href="/uploads/AdminPanelUnfreezeSelectedEvent.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img style="aspect-ratio:749/524;cursor:zoom-in;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelUnfreezeSelectedEvent.jpg" alt="Admin Panel – Unfreeze Selected Event" width="749" height="524"></a></figure></li></ul><p style="margin:10px 0 0;">Now, go ahead and click on this event and edit the date, check <strong>Website Ready</strong>, click <strong>SAVE </strong>button and the event will be live again!</p><figure class="image"><a href="/uploads/AdminPanelWebsiteIsReady_6uXq9By.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img style="aspect-ratio:473/241;cursor:zoom-in;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelWebsiteIsReady_6uXq9By.jpg" alt="Admin Panel – Website Is Ready" width="473" height="241"></a></figure><p style="margin:10px 0 0;">✨ This “Unfreeze” feature saves you the hassle of entering all information over again