lor:#fff7ed;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #fdba74;margin:14px 0 0;padding:12px 14px;"><strong>⚠️ Important</strong><br>Any use or display of offensive, profane, or otherwise inappropriate language or images is strictly prohibited on the NWU website.</div><ul style="margin-bottom:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8px;"><li><p style="margin-left:18px;">You can insert an image into your comment (optional)</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:18px;">To add multiple images, click the green button: <strong>“Show image upload tips” </strong>and read the instructions.</p><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:997/605;" src="/uploads/BlogCommentsAdd_XSS9UJ8.jpg" width="997" height="605"></figure></li><li><p style="margin-left:18px;">Click the <strong>Post Comment</strong> green button.</p><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:213/76;" src="/uploads/BlogPostCommentButton.jpg" width="213" height="76"></figure></li></ul></li></ol><div style="background-color:#ecfdf5;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #86efac;margin:16px 0 10px;padding:12px 14px;"><strong>✅ You’re done!</strong><br>If you are the creator of this post and entered your email in the comment section, your comment will appear on this Blog post right away. Comments from other members are sent to the post creator (that’s you if you created this Blog post) for review. Once approved, those comments will be visible on the Blog.</div><p style="margin:14px 0 0;">🌿 Thank you for sharing your voice with kindness. Every thoughtful comment helps our NWU community grow - step by step, together!</p>', '2026-01-07 18:33:31.458262', '2026-01-19 21:33:08.129753', 34); alias=default
