django.template.base.VariableDoesNotExist: Failed lookup for key [errors] in [{'True': True, 'False': False, 'None': None}, {'widget': {'name': 'body', 'is_hidden': False, 'required': False, 'value': '<p>Sharing comments helps you stay connected with all event members, share important information, and ask or answer questions. Here’s how it works:</p><h4>Open the Event on NWU website.</h4><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:1355/522;" src="/uploads/FindEvent.jpg" width="1355" height="522"></figure><ol><li>Find and click on your <strong>event</strong>.</li><li><strong>Log in</strong> to your account.</li><li><strong>Sign up</strong> for the event (this step is required to comment).</li></ol><h4>View Existing Comments</h4><ul><li>In the event window, click <strong>"Show all comments"</strong>, or click the <strong>total number of participants</strong> link to see all comments.</li></ul><p><i>Note: When comments are shown, the event description will be moved to the bottom of the Event page. You can scroll down to see it.</i></p><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:1188/597;" src="/uploads/EventPageShowAllComments.jpg" width="1188" height="597"></figure><ul><li><p>Click <strong>"Hide all comments"</strong> if you want to hide comments and see only the event description.</p><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:1212/704;" src="/uploads/EventPageHideAllComments_kx9rZzV.jpg" width="1212" height="704"></figure></li></ul><h4>View Comments by a Specific User</h4><ul><li><p>To see a comment from a particular user, click on their <strong>avatar</strong>.</p><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:1188/597;" src="/uploads/EventPageReadParticipantOnlyComment.jpg" width="1188" height="597"></figure></li><li>To see all comments again, click the <strong>total number of participants</strong> link.</li></ul><h4>Write Your Own Comment</h4><ol><li><p>Click the green <strong>"Write comment"</strong> button.</p><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:1188/597;" src="/uploads/EventPageWriteComment.jpg" width="1188" height="597"></figure></li><li>Write your comment in the text box.</li><li>If you want, upload an image in <strong>JPG</strong>, <strong>JPEG</strong>, or <strong>PNG</strong> format.</li><li><p>Submit your comment - and you’re done!</p><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:1192/450;" src="/uploads/EventCommentsSubmit.jpg" width="1192" height="450"></figure></li></ol><p><strong>Enjoy connecting with fellow walkers by asking and answering questions, sharing photos, and exchanging event details. </strong>🌿</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'attrs': {'class': 'django_ckeditor_5', 'id': 'id_body'}, 'template_name': 'django_ckeditor_5/widget.html'}, 'config': {'toolbar': ['heading', 'codeBlock', '|', 'outdent', 'indent', '|', 'bold', 'italic', 'link', 'underline', 'strikethrough', 'code', 'subscript', 'superscript', 'highlight', '|', 'bulletedList', 'numberedList', 'todoList', '|', 'blockQuote', 'insertImage', '|', 'fontSize', 'fontFamily', 'fontColor', 'fontBackgroundColor', 'mediaEmbed', 'removeFormat', 'insertTable', 'sourceEditing'], 'language': 'en', 'blockToolbar': ['paragraph', 'heading1', 'heading2', 'heading3', '|', 'bulletedList', 'numberedList', '|', 'blockQuote'], 'image': {'toolbar': ['imageTextAlternative', '|', 'imageStyle:alignLeft', 'imageStyle:alignRight', 'imageStyle:alignCenter', 'imageStyle:side', '|', 'toggleImageCaption', '|'], 'styles': ['full', 'side', 'alignLeft', 'alignRight', 'alignCenter']}, 'table': {'contentToolbar': ['tableColumn', 'tableRow', 'mergeTableCells', 'tableProperties', 'tableCellProperties'], 'tableProperties': {'borderColors': [{'color': 'hsl(4, 90%, 58%)', 'label': 'Red'}, {'color': 'hsl(340, 82%, 52%)', 'label': 'Pink'}, {'color': 'hsl(291, 64%, 42%)', 'label': 'Purple'}, {'color': 'hsl(262, 52%, 47%)', 'label': 'Deep Purple'}, {'color': 'hsl(231, 48%, 48%)', 'label': 'Indigo'}, {'color': 'hsl(207, 90%, 54%)', 'label': 'Blue'}], 'backgroundColors': [{'color': 'h