django.template.base.VariableDoesNotExist: Failed lookup for key [errors] in [{'True': True, 'False': False, 'None': None}, {'widget': {'name': 'body', 'is_hidden': False, 'required': False, 'value': '<p><strong>Dear Nordic Walking Organizers &amp; Hosts,</strong></p><p>When you’re working in the <strong>Admin Panel</strong>, the text editor is your helper. It helps you format your text so your <strong>event descriptions</strong> and <strong>blog posts</strong> are clear, welcoming, and easy to read.</p><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:1286/204;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelTextEditor.jpg" width="1286" height="204"></figure><p>Below is a simple guide to the most useful tools you’ll use when creating events and sharing stories.</p><hr style="margin:18px 0;"><h3 style="font-size:22px;margin-bottom:8px;"><strong>Bold Text</strong></h3><p>Use <strong>Bold</strong> to highlight important details such as:</p><ul><li>meeting time</li><li>location</li><li>key instructions</li></ul><p><strong>How to use:</strong> Select the text → click <strong>B</strong> (Bold)</p><p><strong>Example:</strong></p><h3 style="font-size:22px;margin-bottom:8px;"><strong>Meeting time: 9:00 AM</strong></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><hr style="margin:18px 0;"><h3 style="font-size:22px;margin-bottom:8px;"><i>Italic Text</i></h3><p>Use <i>Italic</i> to add gentle emphasis.</p><p><strong>How to use:</strong> Select text → click <i>I</i> (Italic)</p><p><strong>Example:</strong> <i>Newcomers are welcome to walk at their own pace.</i></p><figure class="image image-style-align-center"><img style="aspect-ratio:288/177;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelTextEditorBoldAndItalic.jpg" width="288" height="177"></figure><hr style="margin:18px 0;"><h3 style="font-size:22px;margin-bottom:8px;"><u>Underline</u></h3><p>Use <u>Underline</u> sparingly to draw attention to key details.</p><p><strong>How to use:</strong> Select text → click <u>U</u> (Underline)</p><p><strong>Example:</strong> <u>Please arrive 10 minutes early.</u></p><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:161/132;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelTextEditorUnderline.jpg" width="161" height="132"></figure><hr style="margin:18px 0;"><h3 style="font-size:22px;margin-bottom:8px;">• Bullet List</h3><p>Bullet lists make information easy to scan.</p><p><strong>How to use:</strong> Click the <strong>Bullet List</strong> icon, then type items.</p><ul><li>Warm-up exercises</li><li>Nordic walk</li><li>Cool-down stretching</li></ul><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:186/206;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelTextEditorBulletedList.jpg" width="186" height="206"></figure><hr style="margin:18px 0;"><h3 style="font-size:22px;margin-bottom:8px;">1️⃣ Numbered List</h3><p>Ideal for step-by-step instructions.</p><p><strong>How to use:</strong> Click the <strong>Numbered List</strong> icon.</p><ol><li>Gentle warm-up</li><li>Nordic walking practice</li><li><p>Stretching and relaxation</p><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:257/221;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelTextEditorNumberedList.jpg" width="257" height="221"></figure></li></ol><hr style="margin:18px 0;"><h3 style="font-size:22px;margin-bottom:8px;">🖼 Insert Image</h3><p>Images help bring your events and blogs to life.</p><p><strong>How to use:</strong> Click <strong>Insert Image</strong> → upload or select an image → adjust alignment.</p><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:190/185;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelTextEditorInsertImage_OLKOi2n.jpg" width="190" height="185"></figure><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:566/464;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelTextEditorInsertImage2.jpg" width="566" height="464"></figure><p>&nbsp;</p><hr style="margin:18px 0;"><h3 style="font-size:22px;margin-bottom:8px;">🔠 Font Size</h3><p>Adjust font size to improve readability.</p><p><strong>How to use:</strong> Select text → choose a <strong>Font Size</strong> from the dropdown.</p><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:237/264;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelTextEditorFontSize.jpg" width="237" height="264"></figure><hr style="margin:18px 0;"><h3 style="font-size:22px;margin-bottom:8px;">🔤 Font Type</h3><p>Select a font type that looks clean and consistent.</p><p><strong>How to use:</strong> Select text → choose a <strong>Font Type</strong> from the dropdown.</p><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:228/385;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelTextEditorFontType.jpg" width="228" height="385"></figure><hr style="margin:18px 0;"><h3 style="font-size:22px;margin-bottom:8px;">🎨 Font Color</h3><p>Use sparingly to highlight important notes.</p><p><strong>How to use:</strong> Select text → click <strong>Font Color</strong> → choose a color.</p><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:170/261;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelTextEditorFontColor.jpg" width="170" height="261"></figure><hr style="margin:18px 0;"><h3 style="font-size:22px;margin-bottom:8px;">🖍 Font Background Color</h3><p>Great for short reminders or special notices.</p><p><strong>How to use:</strong> Select text → click <strong>Font Background Color</strong> → choose a color.</p><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:303/286;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelTextEditorFontBackgroundColor.jpg" width="303" height="286"></figure><hr style="margin:18px 0;"><h3 style="font-size:22px;margin-bottom:8px;">🌿 Best Practices</h3><ul><li>Keep your text clear, warm, and friendly.</li><li>Use formatting to support readability, not overwhelm.</li><li>Preview your post before publishing.</li></ul><p>Well-formatted posts help participants feel <strong>informed</strong>, <strong>welcome</strong>, and <strong>confident</strong>.</p><p style="margin-top:14px;">✨ <strong>You’re not just posting information — you’re creating an inviting experience for your Nordic Walking community.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'attrs': {'class': 'django_ckeditor_5', 'id': 'id_body'}, 'template_name': 'django_ckeditor_5/widget.html'}, 'config': {'toolbar': ['heading', 'codeBlock', '|', 'outdent', 'indent', '|', 'bold', 'italic', 'link', '