django.template.base.VariableDoesNotExist: Failed lookup for key [errors] in [{'True': True, 'False': False, 'None': None}, {'widget': {'name': 'body', 'is_hidden': False, 'required': False, 'value': '<h3>1. Getting Started 🌿</h3><p>We’re so happy you’re here and interested in bringing Nordic Walking to your community. This guide will walk you step by step through starting a new group or registering an existing Nordic Walking group within our NWU community.</p><p>You can begin in <strong>two easy ways</strong>:</p><ul><li><strong>Option 1:</strong> On the main page, click the green <strong>“Organize a New Nordic Walking Group”</strong> button.</li><li><strong>Option 2:</strong> From the top menu, choose <strong>Quick Links → Organize a Nordic Walking Group</strong>.</li></ul><p>Both options will take you to the same <strong>multi-step application form</strong>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h3>2. Prerequisites to Organize a Nordic Walking Group</h3><p>You are now on the <strong>“Prerequisites to Organize a Nordic Walking Group”</strong> page.</p><p>To continue, please take a moment to read all required documents:</p><ul><li>Click each <strong>green link</strong> next to the checkboxes to open a document.</li><li>Each document will open in a <strong>new browser tab</strong>.</li><li>After reading a document and agreeing with its contents, return to the previous tab and <strong>check the corresponding box</strong>.</li></ul><p>Once all documents are read and all checkboxes are checked, click the green <strong>“Get Started”</strong> button to move forward.</p><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:1547/904;" src="/uploads/Prerequisites1.jpg" width="1547" height="904"></figure><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:1531/557;" src="/uploads/Prerequisites2.jpg" width="1531" height="557"></figure><hr><h3>3. Organizer Commitment 🌱</h3><p>Welcome to the <strong>Nordic Walking Group Organizer Commitment</strong> page!</p><p>Please click the link to read the <strong>Nordic Walking United Code of Conduct</strong>.</p><ul><li>The document will open in a <strong>separate tab</strong>.</li><li><p>After reading and agreeing with it, return to the original tab and click the green <strong>“Sign the Commitment”</strong> button to continue.</p><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:1187/896;" src="/uploads/CommitmentPage.jpg" width="1187" height="896"></figure></li></ul><hr><h3>4. Application to Start a New Nordic Walking Group</h3><p>On this page, you’ll be asked whether you have previously organized a Nordic Walking group within the NWU community.</p><ul><li><strong>Select “Yes”</strong> if you have organized a group with us before - the system will skip ahead to <strong>Step 6</strong>, since we already have most of your details.</li><li><strong>Select “No”</strong> if this is your first time - you’ll continue to <strong>Step 5</strong> to tell us more about yourself and your motivation.</li></ul><p>When ready, click <strong>“Go to Next Step.”</strong></p><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:1179/831;" src="/uploads/ApplicatoinToStartANewNWGroup.jpg" width="1179" height="831"></figure><hr><h3>5. Application for First-Time Organizers</h3><p><i>(This step will be skipped if you have organized a group with NWU before.)</i></p><p>This section helps us learn more about you and your motivation for organizing a Nordic Walking group.</p><p>Please be honest and descriptive - the more you share, the better we can understand your vision, and the smoother the approval process will be.</p><p><strong>All fields are required.</strong></p><p>When finished, click <strong>“Go to Next Step.”</strong></p><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:771/914;" src="/uploads/ApplicationToOrganizeANWGropu.jpg" width="771" height="914"></figure><hr><h3>6. Who Will Be Organizing This Nordic Walking Group?</h3><p>This page helps us understand who will manage your group and events.</p><p><strong>The first section is for the Lead Organizer - that’s you!</strong><br>Please enter your <strong>first name, last name, and email</strong> (all fields are required).</p><p>Below that, you may add <strong>Your organizing team (Moderators)</strong> who will help manage your group and events.<br>Moderators can <strong>create, edit, and delete events</strong> within your group.</p><p>To add more organizers, click the <strong>“+ ”</strong> button.</p><p><strong>Note:</strong> If you need to add moderators in the future, simply send us a request through the <strong>Contact Us</strong> page with your group details and the moderator’s first name, last name, and email.</p><p>When finished, click <strong>“Go to Next Step.”</strong></p><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:790/547;" src="/uploads/WhoWillBeOrgzanisingThisNWgroupAndevent.jpg" width="790" height="547"></figure><hr><h3>7. Your New Nordic Walking Group Details</h3><p>This final page collects details about your group and your first event.</p><p><strong>All fields must be filled in to finish your application.</strong></p><p>Please provide:</p><ul><li><strong>NWU Group Name</strong></li><li><strong>City and Country</strong> where your group is located</li><li><strong>When?</strong> &nbsp; Enter the date of your first event (an approximate date is fine and can be changed later if approved)</li><li><strong>Where?</strong> &nbsp;Enter the location you’re considering (this can also be updated later)</li><li><strong>Anything else you’d like to share?</strong> &nbsp;Add any information that may support your application or help us understand your plans</li></ul><p>Once all required fields are completed, the <strong>“Finish!”</strong> button will activate.</p><p>Click <strong>“Finish”</strong> when you’re ready.</p><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:847/910;" src="/uploads/TellUsALlAboutYourNewNWGroup.jpg" width="847" height="910"></figure><hr><h3>8. Confirmation Page</h3><p>After you submit your form, you’ll see a confirmation message:</p><blockquote><p><i>“Your request to organize a new Nordic Walking United group has been received. Our team will review your application and contact you shortly.”</i></p></blockquote><p>From there, click the link to continue learning about your next steps: <a href="/tutorials/?audience=team"><strong>Read the Organizer’s Manual</strong></a>.</p><hr><h3>9. What Happens Next? 🌍</h3><p>After you submit your application:</p><ul><li>Our team will review it.</li><li>We may contact you by email if we have any questions.</li><li>Once approved, you’ll receive an email with next steps on how to create your first event that will appear on the <strong>NWU Global Map</strong> and <strong>Event List.</strong></li></ul><p><strong>Note:</strong> Your group name will appear on the NWU website only after you create and activate your first real event that people can join.</p><hr><h3>10. Tips for Success</h3><ul><li>Use clear and complete answers - this helps us review your application faster.</li><li>Double-check your email address - we’ll contact you through it.</li><li>If something goes wrong, you can always restart the application later.</li></ul><hr><h3>11. Need Help?</h3><ul><li>If you have any questions or technical issues, please contact us at: <a href="/contact/contact"><strong>Contact Us</strong></a>.</li><li>Our team will be happy to assist you!</li></ul><p>We’re excited to walk this path with you 💚</p><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'attrs': {'class': 'django_ckeditor_5', 'id': 'id_body'}, 'template_name': 'django_ckeditor_5/widget.html'}, 'config': {'toolbar': ['heading', 'codeBlock', '|', 'outdent', 'indent', '|', 'bold', 'italic', 'link', 'underline', 'strikethrough', 'code', 'subscript', 'superscript', 'highlight', '|', 'bulletedList', 'numberedList', 'todoList', '|', 'blockQuote', 'insertImage', '|', 'fontSize', 'fontFamily', 'fontColor', 'fontBackgroundColor', 'mediaEmbed', 'removeFormat', 'insertTable', 'sourceEditing'], 'language': 'en', 'blockToolbar': ['paragraph', 'heading1', 'heading2', 'headin