django.template.base.VariableDoesNotExist: Failed lookup for key [errors] in [{'True': True, 'False': False, 'None': None}, {'widget': {'name': 'body', 'is_hidden': False, 'required': False, 'value': '<p style="margin:0 0 10px;"><strong>We’re so glad you made it here !</strong></p><p style="margin:0 0 10px;">Now that you’ve created your first event, the journey continues - it’s time to create even more wonderful walks!<strong> </strong>Through your energy and enthusiasm in organizing Nordic Walking events, you bring movement, health, and connection to your community - and create something truly meaningful.</p><p style="margin:0 0 16px;">You are now an <strong>Organizer / Moderator</strong> and <strong>Administrator</strong> for your group, and you have full access to the <strong>Admin Panel</strong> with permission to manage your group’s events.</p><p style="margin:0 0 16px;"><strong>To create your next event, please follow these simple steps:</strong></p><ol style="margin-bottom:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;padding:0;"><li style="margin-bottom:14px;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;"><p style="margin-left:22px;"><strong>Log in to the Admin Panel</strong><br>Click the Admin Panel link provided in your Approval email.<br>Log in using your <strong>email</strong> and <strong>password</strong>.</p><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:372/336;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelLogin_mgQs8Bm.jpg" width="372" height="336"></figure></li><li style="margin-bottom:14px;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;"><p style="margin-left:22px;"><strong>Admin Menu &amp; Events</strong><br>After logging in, you’ll see the main sidebar with the sections you have access to.<br>This is your organizer’s workspace - now it’s time to create your next event for your wonderful Nordic Walking group!<br>Look for the <strong>CORE</strong> section and find under it <strong>List of Events</strong>, where all your events are managed.</p><div class="nwu-imgph" style="background-color:#f2f2f2;border-radius:10px;margin:10px 0 14px 22px;padding:10px 12px;">Click any image below to enlarge (opens in a new tab):</div><figure class="image"><a href="/uploads/AdminPanelMainSections_eAIAyJq.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img style="aspect-ratio:884/396;cursor:zoom-in;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelMainSections_eAIAyJq.jpg" alt="Admin Panel – Main Sections" width="884" height="396"></a></figure></li><li style="margin-bottom:14px;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;"><p style="margin-left:22px;"><strong>Clone an Existing Event</strong><br>Click on <strong>List of Events</strong>.<br>On the right side, you’ll see your existing event(s).</p><figure class="image"><a href="/uploads/AdminPanelListOfEvents_1B9tW2c.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img style="aspect-ratio:1898/359;cursor:zoom-in;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelListOfEvents_1B9tW2c.jpg" alt="Admin Panel – List of Events" width="1898" height="359"></a></figure><p style="margin-left:22px;"><br>✔️ Check the box next to any event (for example: <i>“John Sunny Walkers Riga”</i>).<br>Then:</p><ul style="margin-bottom:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8px;"><li><p style="margin-left:18px;">Open the <strong>Action</strong> dropdown</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:18px;">Select <strong>Clone Selected Events</strong></p></li><li><p style="margin-left:18px;">Click the <strong>Go</strong> button</p><figure class="image"><a href="/uploads/AdminPanelCloneEvent.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img style="aspect-ratio:692/429;cursor:zoom-in;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelCloneEvent.jpg" alt="Admin Panel – Clone Event" width="692" height="429"></a></figure></li></ul></li><li style="margin-bottom:14px;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;"><p style="margin-left:22px;"><strong>Find Your Cloned Event</strong><br>You will now see an exact copy of the event with <strong>“CLONE EVENT”</strong> added to its name (for example: <i>“John Sunny Walkers Riga CLONE EVENT”</i>).</p><figure class="image"><a href="/uploads/AdminPanelViewCLonedEventInList.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img style="aspect-ratio:717/518;cursor:zoom-in;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelViewCLonedEventInList.jpg" alt="Admin Panel – View Cloned Event in List" width="717" height="518"></a></figure></li><li style="margin-bottom:14px;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;"><p style="margin-left:22px;"><strong>Edit the Cloned Event</strong><br>Click on the <strong>CLONE EVENT</strong> and update all fields so they match your new event:</p><ul style="margin-bottom:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8px;"><li><p style="margin-left:18px;">Date &amp; time</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:18px;">Location</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:18px;">Any other details</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:18px;">✏️ Don’t forget to update the event description text box</p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:22px;">Make it warm, welcoming, and inspiring - just like your group!</p><p>We strongly recommend adding <strong>detailed information</strong> about your event. You may include:</p><ul><li>Terrain description</li><li>What to bring</li><li>What to expect</li><li>Weather considerations</li><li>Benefits of this walk</li></ul><p>Adding a <strong>photo of the meeting place</strong> helps participants find you more easily.</p><div style="background-color:#fff8cc;border-left:6px solid #f2c94c;font-size:1.05em;line-height:1.5;margin:16px 0;padding:14px 16px;"><strong>Important:</strong> Images should be no more than <strong>700 × 700 px</strong>. Larger images may take up too much space in the event description on the website.</div><p>The text field supports:</p><ul><li>Headings</li><li>Bold / italic text</li><li>Bullet and numbered lists</li><li>Links</li><li>Images</li></ul><p><strong>Formatting tips:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Headings:</strong> Use the Heading dropdown (e.g., <i>Route</i>, <i>What to Bring</i>).</li><li><strong>Lists:</strong> Great for schedules, gear, or directions.</li><li><strong>Links:</strong> Select text → click the Link icon → paste a URL.</li><li><strong>Images:</strong> Click the image icon → Upload → choose a file. Recommended width: ~700 px.</li></ul><div class="nwu-note">Click the link to view detailed Text Editor instructions (opens in a new tab): <a href="https://www.nordicwalkingunited.org/en/tutorials/using-the-text-editor-while-creating-events-and-bl/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Using the Text Editor While Creating Events and Blogs&nbsp;</a></div><figure class="image"><a href="/uploads/AdminPanelViewCloneEvent.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img style="aspect-ratio:1877/640;cursor:zoom-in;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelViewCloneEvent.jpg" alt="Admin Panel – Cloned Event View" width="1877" height="640"></a></figure></li><li style="margin-bottom:14px;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;"><p style="margin-left:22px;"><strong>Save and Publish</strong><br>When everything looks right:</p><ul style="margin-bottom:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:8px;"><li><p style="margin-left:18px;">✔️ Check the <strong>Website is Ready</strong> checkbox</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:18px;">Click the <strong>SAVE</strong> button</p><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:473/241;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelWebsiteIsReady.jpg" width="473" height="241"></figure></li></ul></li><li style="margin-bottom:0;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;"><p style="margin-left:22px;"><strong>Your Event Is Live! 🎉</strong><br>Your event is now live on the NWU website!<br>You and your group co-organizers will receive a confirmation email shortly.<br><br>Have a wonderful time walking, connecting, and sharing joy with your group members.<br><strong>Thank you for being a heartbeat of Nordic Walking United!</strong></p></li></ol><p>&nbsp;</p>', 'attrs': {'class': 'django_ckeditor_5', 'id': 'id_body'}, 'template_name': 'django_ckeditor_5/widget.html'}, 'config': {'toolbar': ['heading', 'codeBlock', '|', 'outdent', 'indent', '|', 'bold', 'italic', 'link', 'underline', 'strikethrough', 'code', 'subscript', 'superscript', 'highli