ming <strong>Title</strong>.</li><li>Select the correct <strong>Group</strong>.</li><li>Write your blog content using the text editor.</li></ol><div style="background-color:#fff8cc;border-left:6px solid #f2c94c;margin:18px 0;padding:14px 16px;"><strong>Important:</strong> Images should be no more than <strong>700 × 700 px</strong>. Larger images may take up too much space in the blog section.</div><p style="text-align:right;"><a href="#top">↑ Back to menu</a></p><h3 id="step4">Step 4. Publish Your Blog</h3><ol><li>Review your post for clarity and layout.</li><li>Click <strong>Save</strong> or <strong>Publish</strong>.</li><li>Your blog will be visible to the entire NWU community.</li></ol><p style="text-align:right;"><a href="#top">↑ Back to menu</a></p><h3 id="step5">Step 5. Manage Comments on Your Blog</h3><ul><li>Read comments from community members.</li><li>Reply to comments to encourage engagement.</li><li>Delete inappropriate comments if needed.</li></ul><p style="text-align:right;"><a href="#top">↑ Back to menu</a></p><h3 id="step6">Step 6. Delete Your Blog Post</h3><ol><li>Open the blog post in the Admin Panel.</li><li>Click <strong>Delete</strong>.</li><li>Confirm the deletion.</li></ol><p style="text-align:right;"><a href="#top">↑ Back to menu</a></p><div style="background-color:#f3fff1;border-left:6px solid #27ae60;margin:18px 0;padding:14px 16px;"><strong>NWU reminder:</strong> Blogs help preserve memories, build connection, and inspire others to join Nordic Walking 🌞</div></div>', 'attrs': {'class': 'django_ckeditor_5', 'id': 'id_body'}, 'template_name': 'django_ckeditor_5/widget.html'}, 'config': {'toolbar': ['heading', 'codeBlock', '|', 'outdent', 'indent', '|', 'bold', 'italic', 'link', 'underline', 'strikethrough', 'code', 'subscript', 'superscript', 'highlight', '|', 'bulletedList', 'numberedList', 'todoList', '|', 'blockQuote', 'insertImage', '|', 'fontSize', 'fontFamily', 'fontColor', 'fontBackgroundColor', 'mediaEmbed', 'removeFormat', 'insertTa