Click <strong>+ Add</strong> or <strong>Add Post +&nbsp;</strong></p><div class="nwu-imgph" style="background-color:#f2f2f2;border-radius:10px;margin:10px 0 14px 22px;padding:10px 12px;">Click any image below to enlarge (opens in a new tab):</div><figure class="image"><a href="/uploads/AdminPanelAddPost.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img style="aspect-ratio:1872/422;cursor:zoom-in;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelAddPost.jpg" alt="Admin Panel – Add Post" width="1872" height="422"></a></figure></li></ul><p style="text-align:right;"><a href="#top">↑ Back to menu</a></p><h3 id="step3">Step 3. Create Your Blog Post</h3><ol><li>Click <strong>Add Blog</strong> (or <strong>+ Add</strong>).</li><li>Enter a clear and welcoming <strong>Title</strong>.</li><li>Select the correct <strong>Group</strong>.</li><li>Write your blog content using the text editor.</li></ol><div style="background-color:#fff8cc;border-left:6px solid #f2c94c;margin:18px 0;padding:14px 16px;"><strong>Important:</strong> Images should be no more than <strong>700 × 700 px</strong>. Larger images may take up too much space in the blog section.</div><p style="text-align:right;"><a href="#top">↑ Back to menu</a></p><h3 id="step4">Step 4. Publish Your Blog</h3><ol><li>Review your post for clarity and layout.</li><li>Click <strong>Save</strong> or <strong>Publish</strong>.</li><li>Your blog will be visible to the entire NWU community.</li></ol><p style="text-align:right;"><a href="#top">↑ Back to menu</a></p><h3 id="step5">Step 5. Manage Comments on Your Blog</h3><ul><li>Read comments from community members.</li><li>Reply to comments to encourage engagement.</li><li>Delete inappropriate comments if needed.</li></ul><p style="text-align:right;"><a href="#top">↑ Back to menu</a></p><h3 id="step6">Step 6. Delete Your Blog Post</h3><ol><li>Open the blog post in the Admin Panel.</li><li>Click <strong>Delete</strong>.</li><li>Confirm the deletion.</li></ol><p style="text-align:right;"><a href="#top">↑ Back t