Click <strong>+ Add</strong> or <strong>Add Post +&nbsp;</strong></p><div class="nwu-imgph" style="background-color:#f2f2f2;border-radius:10px;margin:10px 0 14px 22px;padding:10px 12px;">Click any image below to enlarge (opens in a new tab):</div><figure class="image"><a href="/uploads/AdminPanelAddPost.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img style="aspect-ratio:1872/422;cursor:zoom-in;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelAddPost.jpg" alt="Admin Panel – Add Post" width="1872" height="422"></a></figure></li></ul><p style="text-align:right;"><a href="#top">↑ Back to menu</a></p><h3 id="step3">Step 3. Create Your Blog Post</h3><p style="margin:0 0 8px;">Now the fun part! 🎉</p><ul style="margin-bottom:16px;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;"><li><p style="margin-left:22px;">Enter the <strong>Title</strong> of your blog post</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:22px;">Write your text in the editor</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:22px;">Add photos directly into the text if you wish</p></li></ul><div style="background-color:#fff8cc;border-left:6px solid #f2c94c;margin:18px 0;padding:14px 16px;"><strong>Important:</strong> Images should be no more than <strong>700 × 700 px</strong>. Larger images may take up too much space in the blog section.</div><ul style="margin-bottom:16px;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;"><li><p style="margin-left:22px;">Use the editor tools to format your post and make it clear, welcoming, and beautiful</p></li></ul><div class="nwu-note" style="background-color:#fff7cc;border-radius:10px;margin:14px 0;padding:12px 14px;">Click the link to view detailed Text Editor instructions (opens in a new tab): <a href="https://www.nordicwalkingunited.org/en/tutorials/using-the-text-editor-while-creating-events-and-bl/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Using the Text Editor While Creating Events and Blogs&nbsp;</a></div><p style="text-align:right;"><a href="#top">↑ Back to menu</a></p><h3 id="step4">Step 4. Publish Your Blog</h3><ol><li>Review your post for clarity and layout.</li><li>Click <strong>Save</strong> or <strong>Publish</strong>.</li><li>Your blog will be visible to the entire NWU community.</li></ol><p style="text-align:right;"><a href="#top">↑ Back to menu</a></p><h3 id="step5">Step 5. Manage Comments on Your Blog</h3><ul><li>Read comments from community members.</li><li>Reply to comments to encourage engagement.</li><li>Delete inappropriate comments if needed.</li></ul><p style="text-align:right;"><a href="#top">↑ Back to menu</a></p><h3 id="step6">Step 6. Delete Your Blog Post</h3><ol><li>Open the blog post in the Admin Panel.</li><li>Click <strong>Delete</strong>.</li><li>Confirm the deletion.</li></ol><p style="text-align:right;"><a href="#top">↑ Back to menu</a></p><div style="background-color:#f3fff1;border-left:6px solid #27ae60;margin:18px 0;padding:14px 16px;"><strong>NWU reminder:</strong> Blogs help preserve memories, build connection, and inspire others to join Nordic Walking 🌞</div></div>', 'attrs': {'class': 'django_ckeditor_5', 'id': 'id_body'}, 'template_name': 'django_ckeditor_5/widget.html'}, 'config': {'toolbar': ['heading', 'codeBlock', '|', 'outdent', 'indent', '|', 'bold', 'italic', 'link', 'underline', 'strikethrough', 'code', 'subscript', 'superscript', 'highlight', '|', 'bulletedList', 'numberedList', 'todoList', '|', 'blockQuote', 'insertImage', '|', 'fontSize', 'fontFamily', 'fontColor', 'fontBackgroundColor', 'mediaEmbed', 'removeFormat', 'insertTable', 'sourceEditing'], 'language': 'en', 'blockToolbar': ['paragraph', 'heading1', 'heading2', 'heading3', '|', 'bulletedList', 'numberedList', '|', 'blockQuote'], 'image': {'toolbar': ['imageTextAlternative', '|', 'imageStyle:alignLeft', 'imageStyle:alignRight', 'imageStyle:alignCenter', 'imageStyle:side', '|', 'toggleImageCaption', '|'], 'styles': ['full', 'side', 'alignLeft', 'alignRight', 'alignCenter']}, 'table': {'contentToolbar': ['tableColumn', 'tableRow', 'mergeTableCells', 'tableProperties', 'tableCellProperties'], 'tablePropertie