Click <strong>+ Add</strong> or <strong>Add Post +&nbsp;</strong></p><div class="nwu-imgph" style="background-color:#f2f2f2;border-radius:10px;margin:10px 0 14px 22px;padding:10px 12px;">Click any image below to enlarge (opens in a new tab):</div><figure class="image"><a href="/uploads/AdminPanelAddPost.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img style="aspect-ratio:1872/422;cursor:zoom-in;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelAddPost.jpg" alt="Admin Panel – Add Post" width="1872" height="422"></a></figure></li></ul><p style="text-align:right;"><a href="#top">↑ Back to menu</a></p><h3 id="step3">Step 3. Create Your Blog Post</h3><p style="margin:0 0 8px;">Now the fun part! 🎉</p><ul style="margin-bottom:16px;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;"><li><p style="margin-left:22px;">Enter the <strong>Title</strong> of your blog post</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:22px;">Write your text in the editor</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:22px;">Add photos directly into the text if you wish</p></li></ul><div style="background-color:#fff8cc;border-left:6px solid #f2c94c;margin:18px 0;padding:14px 16px;"><strong>Important:</strong> Images should be no more than <strong>700 × 700 px</strong>. Larger images may take up too much space in the blog section.</div><ul style="margin-bottom:16px;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;"><li><p style="margin-left:22px;">Use the editor tools to format your post and make it clear, welcoming, and beautiful</p></li></ul><div class="nwu-note" style="background-color:#fff7cc;border-radius:10px;margin:14px 0;padding:12px 14px;">Click the link to view detailed Text Editor instructions (opens in a new tab): <a href="https://www.nordicwalkingunited.org/en/tutorials/using-the-text-editor-while-creating-events-and-bl/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Using the Text Editor While Creating Events and Blogs&nbsp;</a></div><p style="text-align:right;"><a href="#top">↑ Back to menu</a></p><h3 id="step4">Step 4. Publish Your Blog</h3><p style="margin:0 0 10px;">When your post is ready:</p><ul style="margin-bottom:12px;margin-right:0;margin-top:0;"><li><p style="margin-left:22px;">✅ Check the <strong>“Is published”</strong> checkbox</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:22px;">Click the <strong>SAVE</strong> button (see above)</p></li></ul><figure class="image"><a href="/uploads/AdminPanelBlogWirtten.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img style="aspect-ratio:1020/813;cursor:zoom-in;" src="/uploads/AdminPanelBlogWirtten.jpg" alt="Admin Panel – Blog Written" width="1020" height="813"></a></figure><p style="background-color:#f2f7ff;border-left:5px solid #1e88e5;border-radius:10px;margin:0 0 18px;padding:12px 14px;">🎉 <strong>Great job!</strong> Your blog post is now live and visible to the entire NWU community. You can see your blog on NWU website: <a href="https://www.nordicwalkingunited.org/en/blog/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">www.nordicwalkingunited.org/en/blog/&nbsp;</a></p><figure class="image"><a href="/uploads/AdminPanelBlogDeletePost.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img style="aspect-ratio:1312/317;cursor:zoom-in;" src="/uploads/Blog1_pP2wS9q.jpg" alt="Blog image" width="1312" height="317"></a></figure><figure class="image"><img style="aspect-ratio:819/673;" src="/uploads/Blog2_6tvZZur.jpg" width="819" height="673"></figure><p style="text-align:right;"><a href="#top">↑ Back to menu</a></p><h3 id="step5">Step 5. Manage Comments on Your Blog</h3><ul><li>Read comments from community members.</li><li>Reply to comments to encourage engagement.</li><li>Delete inappropriate comments if needed.</li></ul><p style="text-align:right;"><a href="#top">↑ Back to menu</a></p><h3 id="step6">Step 6. Delete Your Blog Post</h3><ol><li>Open the blog post in the Admin Panel.</li><li>Click <strong>Delete</strong>.</li><li>Confirm the deletion.</li></ol><p style="text-align:right;"><a href="#top">↑ Back to menu</a></p><div style="background-color:#f3fff1;border-left:6px solid #27ae60;margin:18px 0;padding:14px